title: "freethreaded-python-benchmarks: Matched-design benchmark suite for functional programming patterns in free-threaded Python"
abstract: "Reproducibility artifact for a matched-design empirical study of functional programming patterns in free-threaded Python: benchmark suite, raw per-run measurements, and analysis scripts covering race-freedom, coordination cost, and the Writer monad."
